{
  "tools": [
    {
      "name": "asset_dependencies",
      "title": "Asset Dependencies",
      "toolset": "asset",
      "description": "Walk an asset's relationships - the assets it references (uses), the assets that depend on it, or the assets it was generated from. Deep recurses the whole chain, e.g. a model's materials and their textures.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "path": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Asset path, as returned by asset_search."
          },
          "relation": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "References",
              "Dependants",
              "Parents"
            ],
            "description": "Which direction to walk.",
            "default": "References"
          },
          "deep": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "Recurse instead of returning only direct relationships.",
            "default": false
          },
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Filter results to one asset type - a file extension or friendly name. See asset_types."
          },
          "limit": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "How many results to return.",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 500,
            "default": 100
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "path"
        ]
      },
      "annotations": {
        "readOnlyHint": true
      },
      "outputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "Path": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "Relation": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "Total": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "How many related assets exist, beyond what's shown."
          },
          "Assets": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "Path": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "Type": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              },
              "required": []
            }
          }
        },
        "required": []
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "asset_search",
      "title": "Asset Search",
      "toolset": "asset",
      "description": "Search the asset system by keywords and type. An empty query lists every asset, so use limit and offset to page through. Returns relative asset paths - pass one to asset_info, asset_compile, asset_read or asset_dependencies.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "query": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Space separated keywords. Every keyword must match the asset's path or one of its tags. Empty matches everything."
          },
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Filter to one asset type - a file extension (vmdl, vmat, prefab) or friendly name (Model, Material). See asset_types."
          },
          "projectOnly": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "Only assets belonging to the currently open project, excluding engine content and cloud downloads.",
            "default": false
          },
          "unreferencedOnly": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "Only assets nothing else references - useful for finding unused assets. Note map files and code can use an asset without the asset system knowing.",
            "default": false
          },
          "compileFailedOnly": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "Only assets whose last compile failed.",
            "default": false
          },
          "uncompiledOnly": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "Only assets with no compiled version at all.",
            "default": false
          },
          "limit": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "How many results to return.",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 500,
            "default": 50
          },
          "offset": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "How many results to skip, for paging.",
            "default": 0
          }
        },
        "required": []
      },
      "annotations": {
        "readOnlyHint": true
      },
      "outputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "Total": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "How many assets matched in total, beyond this page."
          },
          "Showing": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "Offset": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "Assets": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "Path": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "Type": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              },
              "required": []
            }
          }
        },
        "required": []
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "asset_thumbnail",
      "title": "Asset Thumbnail",
      "toolset": "asset",
      "description": "Render an asset's preview thumbnail and return it as an image - see what a model, material or texture actually looks like.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "path": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Asset path, as returned by asset_search."
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "path"
        ]
      },
      "annotations": {
        "readOnlyHint": true
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "hammer_asset_usage",
      "title": "Asset Usage",
      "toolset": "hammer",
      "description": "Which assets the map uses and how heavily - mesh materials with how many faces, triangles and square units of surface they cover, models and other assets in entity keyvalues, and resources on game object components. Counts the map as placed: everything inside a prefab counts once per placement, nested prefabs included, so Nodes, Faces and Triangles track what gets drawn. With no asset, lists every asset sorted by 'sortBy'; give an asset to list where it's placed - inside a prefab, that's the prefab node placed in the map.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "asset": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "An asset path to find users of. Empty summarises everything."
          },
          "sortBy": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Sort the summary by Nodes, Faces, Triangles or Area.",
            "default": "Nodes"
          },
          "includePrefabs": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "Count what's inside prefabs placed in the map, not just the map's own nodes.",
            "default": true
          },
          "limit": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "How many entries to return.",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 1000,
            "default": 200
          }
        },
        "required": []
      },
      "annotations": {
        "readOnlyHint": true
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "hammer_assign_asset",
      "title": "Assign Asset",
      "toolset": "hammer",
      "description": "Apply an asset to nodes the way dropping it onto them in Hammer does - a material paints every face of the meshes (or just the selected faces, in Faces mode), a model swaps a prop's model. Give node ids, or nothing to apply to the current selection. Selects the nodes it applied to. The user can undo this.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "asset": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "The material or model asset path."
          },
          "ids": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "description": "Node ids to apply to. Empty applies to the current selection."
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "asset"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "hammer_create_mesh",
      "title": "Create Mesh",
      "toolset": "hammer",
      "description": "Build brush geometry from raw polygons - for shapes the primitives don't cover, like ramps, arches or custom trim. Faces index into the vertex list and are wound counter-clockwise seen from the side they face (the right-hand rule gives the outward normal). Vertices shared by faces get welded. The user can undo this. Returns the new mesh node.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "vertices": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "description": "World space vertex positions, each 'x,y,z'."
          },
          "faces": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "Indices": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "type": "integer"
                  },
                  "description": "Indices into the vertex list, counter-clockwise seen from the side the face points."
                },
                "Material": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "This face's material. Empty uses the mesh's material."
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "Indices"
              ]
            },
            "description": "The polygons, each at least 3 vertex indices."
          },
          "material": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Material for faces that don't set their own. Empty uses the material active in Hammer's material browser."
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "vertices",
          "faces"
        ]
      },
      "outputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "Id": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "Kind": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "Name": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "ClassName": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "Description": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "Position": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "Parent": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "GameObject": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "Selected": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "Visible": {
            "type": "boolean"
          }
        },
        "required": []
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "hammer_create_primitive",
      "title": "Create Primitive",
      "toolset": "hammer",
      "description": "Build brush geometry fitted to a box, like dragging out Hammer's block tool - a box by default, or any shape hammer_list_primitives lists (stairs, cylinder, sphere...). Rooms are boxes: floor, walls and ceiling, or a 'Hollow' box. The user can undo this. Returns the new mesh node.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "mins": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "One corner of the bounds, as 'x,y,z'."
          },
          "maxs": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "The opposite corner of the bounds, as 'x,y,z'."
          },
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "The shape, by name from hammer_list_primitives - 'Box', 'Stairs', 'Cylinder'...",
            "default": "Box"
          },
          "material": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Material for every face. Empty uses the material active in Hammer's material browser."
          },
          "options": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "The shape's options as a json object, e.g. {\"NumberOfSteps\": 8} for stairs or {\"Options\": \"Hollow\"} for a room. hammer_list_primitives lists them."
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "mins",
          "maxs"
        ]
      },
      "outputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "Id": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "Kind": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "Name": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "ClassName": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "Description": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "Position": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "Parent": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "GameObject": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "Selected": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "Visible": {
            "type": "boolean"
          }
        },
        "required": []
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "hammer_find_hidden_faces",
      "title": "Find Hidden Faces",
      "toolset": "hammer",
      "description": "Find mesh faces nobody can see because they're buried inside or pressed flat against other geometry - the underside of a crate sitting on a floor, wall ends tucked into other walls. They still cost rendering and lightmap space. By default this only reports; set apply to paint them nodraw (or another material) in one undo step. A face counts as hidden only if every sample point on it is enclosed by opaque, non-tools mesh geometry, so partly covered faces are left alone. Meshes that aren't closed can fool it - check the result with hammer_focus_nodes and hammer_screenshot before applying on a map you care about.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "ids": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "description": "Mesh node ids to check. Empty checks every mesh."
          },
          "apply": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "Paint the hidden faces with 'material'. False only reports them.",
            "default": false
          },
          "material": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "The material to paint hidden faces with.",
            "default": "materials/tools/toolsnodraw.vmat"
          },
          "limit": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "How many meshes to list in the report.",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 1000,
            "default": 100
          }
        },
        "required": []
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "hammer_get_node",
      "title": "Get Node",
      "toolset": "hammer",
      "description": "Everything about one map node - transform, parent and children, and depending on its kind: an entity's class and every keyvalue, a mesh's face materials, a game object's id and components, or an instance's target.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "The node id, from hammer_find_nodes or hammer_get_selection."
          },
          "includeComponentProperties": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "Include the full serialized properties of a game object's components, not just their types.",
            "default": false
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "id"
        ]
      },
      "annotations": {
        "readOnlyHint": true
      },
      "outputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "Angles": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "Scale": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "ChildCount": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "Children": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "Id": {
                  "type": "integer"
                },
                "Kind": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "Name": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "ClassName": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "Description": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "Position": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "Parent": {
                  "type": "integer"
                },
                "GameObject": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "Selected": {
                  "type": "boolean"
                },
                "Visible": {
                  "type": "boolean"
                }
              },
              "required": []
            }
          },
          "EntityClassTitle": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "KeyValues": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "Materials": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "Components": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "Type": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "Id": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "Enabled": {
                  "type": "boolean"
                },
                "Properties": {}
              },
              "required": []
            }
          },
          "Tags": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "InstanceTarget": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "Id": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "Kind": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "Name": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "ClassName": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "Description": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "Position": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "Parent": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "GameObject": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "Selected": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "Visible": {
            "type": "boolean"
          }
        },
        "required": []
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "hammer_mesh_faces",
      "title": "Mesh Faces",
      "toolset": "hammer",
      "description": "A mesh's individual faces - each one's index, material, normal, center, area and triangle count. Face indices are what hammer_set_face_material takes.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "The mesh node id."
          },
          "includeVertices": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "Include each face's corner positions.",
            "default": false
          },
          "limit": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "How many faces to return.",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 5000,
            "default": 500
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "id"
        ]
      },
      "annotations": {
        "readOnlyHint": true
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "hammer_mesh_stats",
      "title": "Mesh Stats",
      "toolset": "hammer",
      "description": "Geometry cost of the map's meshes - per mesh its face and triangle count, size, and faces per material, heaviest first, plus map totals. Use it to find the meshes worth simplifying.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "ids": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "description": "Mesh node ids to measure. Empty measures every mesh."
          },
          "sortBy": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Sort by Triangles, Faces or Size (bounding box volume).",
            "default": "Triangles"
          },
          "limit": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "How many meshes to list.",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 1000,
            "default": 50
          }
        },
        "required": []
      },
      "annotations": {
        "readOnlyHint": true
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "hammer_overlays_to_decals",
      "title": "Overlays To Decals",
      "toolset": "hammer",
      "description": "Replace overlays with Decal game objects - both static overlays (kind Overlay) and info_overlay entities. Each overlay's material becomes a .decal asset (made once per material from its color, normal and roughness textures, reused if one already exists in the folder), and a game object with a Decal component goes on the surface the overlay covered, the same size and facing the same way. One undo step covers the whole swap. Set dryRun to see what would happen first.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "ids": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "description": "Overlay node ids to convert. Empty converts every overlay in the map."
          },
          "decalFolder": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Folder in the project's assets for the generated .decal files.",
            "default": "decals/overlays"
          },
          "keepOverlays": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "Keep the overlays after creating the decals, instead of deleting them.",
            "default": false
          },
          "dryRun": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "Only report what would be converted - create and delete nothing.",
            "default": false
          }
        },
        "required": []
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "hammer_replace_material",
      "title": "Replace Material",
      "toolset": "hammer",
      "description": "Replace one material with another on every face in the map that uses it - retexture a whole map in one call. Leaves those faces selected in Faces mode so the user sees what changed. The user can undo this.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "from": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "The material to replace, e.g. 'materials/dev/reflectivity_30.vmat'. hammer_asset_usage lists the map's materials."
          },
          "to": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "The material to use instead."
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "from",
          "to"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "hammer_select",
      "title": "Select",
      "toolset": "hammer",
      "description": "Change Hammer's selection - select nodes by id and/or everything using an asset, optionally switching selection mode first. Selecting is how you show the user what you mean, and some tools (hammer_run_command, hammer_assign_asset) act on the selection. Returns the new selection.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "ids": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "description": "Node ids to select. Empty selects nothing by id."
          },
          "usingAsset": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Also select every node using this asset - a model or material path."
          },
          "add": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "Add to the current selection instead of replacing it.",
            "default": false
          },
          "mode": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "Groups",
              "Objects",
              "Meshes",
              "Verticies",
              "Edges",
              "Faces",
              "Nav",
              "Tiles"
            ],
            "description": "Switch selection mode first - Groups, Objects or Meshes. Empty keeps the current mode."
          }
        },
        "required": []
      },
      "outputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "Mode": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "Pivot": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "Count": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "Nodes": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "Id": {
                  "type": "integer"
                },
                "Kind": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "Name": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "ClassName": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "Description": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "Position": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "Parent": {
                  "type": "integer"
                },
                "GameObject": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "Selected": {
                  "type": "boolean"
                },
                "Visible": {
                  "type": "boolean"
                }
              },
              "required": []
            }
          }
        },
        "required": []
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "hammer_set_face_material",
      "title": "Set Face Material",
      "toolset": "hammer",
      "description": "Paint individual faces of a mesh with a material, by face index from hammer_mesh_faces. The user can undo this.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "The mesh node id."
          },
          "faces": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "description": "Face indices from hammer_mesh_faces."
          },
          "material": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "The material to paint them with."
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "id",
          "faces",
          "material"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "hammer_status",
      "title": "Status",
      "toolset": "hammer",
      "description": "Whether Hammer is open and what map it's editing - the map's asset path, unsaved changes, how many nodes of each kind it has, the selection mode and count, and the material active in Hammer's material browser. Start here before any other hammer_ tool. If Hammer isn't open, hammer_open_map opens a map in it.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {},
        "required": []
      },
      "annotations": {
        "readOnlyHint": true
      },
      "outputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "Open": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "MapOpen": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "Map": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "File": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "HasUnsavedChanges": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "NodeCounts": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": {
              "type": "integer"
            }
          },
          "SelectionMode": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "SelectedCount": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "CurrentMaterial": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "ViewCount": {
            "type": "integer"
          }
        },
        "required": []
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "hammer_trace",
      "title": "Trace Ray",
      "toolset": "hammer",
      "description": "Trace a ray through the open map and report the first node it hits, where, and the surface normal - find the floor under a point, check what's in front of the camera, or probe where to place something. Traces Hammer's own geometry, so it works before the map is compiled.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "from": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Ray start as 'x,y,z'."
          },
          "to": {
            "type": "string",
